{"id": "ho-t01", "category": "ho_target", "query": "我买了120块的东西还要不要付邮费？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "glm-5.3", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t01-a10c64", "answer": "不用付邮费。本店单笔订单实付满 99 元即包邮（偏远地区除外），您这单 120 元已超过门槛，无需运费。\n\n小提醒：如果您收货地址在新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分地区，运费会按实际计算，下单时页面会显示应付运费。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 1915, "output_tokens": 95, "total_tokens": 2010, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 11222.9, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t02", "category": "ho_target", "query": "一单买了88元，邮费具体是几块？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "glm-5.3", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t02-95fd40", "answer": "您好！根据本店运费政策：\n\n- 包邮门槛是单笔订单实付满 **99 元**（偏远地区除外），88 元还未达到门槛；\n- 未满 99 元需支付运费 **8 元**；\n- 新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分地区按实际运费计算，下单页面会显示具体金额。\n\n所以您这单 88 元的运费是 8 元（偏远地区除外），最终以下单页面显示的运费为准。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2028, "output_tokens": 135, "total_tokens": 2163, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 12434.0, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
